  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Create a new button in the quick menu which, if properly set up by the world creator, allows players to fire triggers directly from their quick menu.\n\nJust like the emoji and emote menu you click the button and a new set of buttons appear.\n\nSome practical examples would be turning music/particle effects/mirrors in a world locally off, quick travel to certain points from anywhere or summon props.",
